|               |         ProjectionExec: expr=[l_extendedprice@1 * (1 - l_discount@0) as __common_expr_1, p_type@4 as p_type]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |           HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(p_partkey@0, l_partkey@2)], projection=[l_discount@2, l_extendedprice@3, l_partkey@4, p_partkey@0, p_type@1]                                                                                                                                                              |
